\mu_{21}=\mu_{0}+\alpha_{2}+\beta_{1}+\gamma_{21}=1+0+1+0=2 & \mu_{22}=\mu_{0}+\alpha_{2}+\beta_{2}+\gamma_{22}=1+1+1-2=1
